# ABP Virtual File System

## Embedding Files
```csharp
Configure<AbpVirtualFileSystemOptions>(options =>
{
    options.FileSets.AddEmbedded<MyModule>("MyNamespace");
});
```

## .csproj Configuration
```xml
<ItemGroup>
  <EmbeddedResource Include="Localization\**\*.json" />
  <Content Remove="Localization\**\*.json" />
</ItemGroup>
```

## Reading Virtual Files
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IVirtualFileProvider _virtualFileProvider;

    public string ReadFile(string path)
    {
        var file = _virtualFileProvider.GetFileInfo(path);
        using var stream = file.CreateReadStream();
        using var reader = new StreamReader(stream);
        return reader.ReadToEnd();
    }
}
```

## Use Cases
- Localization JSON files
- Razor views in libraries
- Static resources in modules
